msgid "<a href=\"https://thrive.zohopublic.com/aref/G4734hGpxD/mBWuIqNh8\" target=\"_blank\" >Trust Swiftly</a> is a paid, external service that uses AI to verify the identity and payment of a customer. By using <a href=\"https://thrive.zohopublic.com/aref/G4734hGpxD/mBWuIqNh8\" target=\"_blank\" >Trust Swiftly</a> you can decrease fraud by automatically verifying their information and later use the data to win any dispute cases. To sign up for Trust Swiftly, click this link: <a href=\"https://thrive.zohopublic.com/aref/G4734hGpxD/mBWuIqNh8\" target=\"_blank\">trustswiftly.com</a><hr/>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://thrive.zohopublic.com/aref/g4734hgpxd/mbwuiqnh8\" target=\"_blank\"> fidati rapidamente </a> è un servizio esterno a pagamento che utilizza l'intelligenza artificiale per verificare l'identità e il pagamento di un cliente. Usando <a href=\"https://thrive.zohopublic.com/aref/g4734hgpxd/mbwuiqnh8\" target=\"_blank\"> fidati rapidamente </a> puoi ridurre le frodi verificando automaticamente le loro informazioni e in seguito utilizzare i dati per Vinci eventuali casi di controversie. Per iscriverti a Trust Swiftly, fai clic su questo link: <a href=\"https://thrive.zohopublic.com/aref/g4734hgpxd/mbwuiqnh8\" target=\"_blank\"> trustswiftly.com </a> <hr/>"

